msgid "### 5.1 Mixed Prefill/Decode Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 混合 Prefill/Decode 部署"

msgid "Before starting the service:"
msgstr "启动服务之前："

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, local IP address, network interface, service port, and DP RPC port with values from the target environment.\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"    - Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 3 must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
"    - Assign `--data-parallel-start-rank` values `1`, `2`, and `3` to Nodes 1, 2, and 3 respectively."
msgstr ""
"- 将模型路径、本地 IP 地址、网络接口、服务端口和 DP RPC 端口替换为目标环境中的值。\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的接口。\n"
"    - 首先启动节点 0。节点 1 到节点 3 上配置的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于节点 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"    - 分别为节点 1、节点 2 和节点 3 分配 `--data-parallel-start-rank` 值 `1`、`2` 和 `3`。"

msgid "=== \"Node 0\""
msgstr "=== \"节点 0\""

msgid "=== \"Nodes 1-3\""
msgstr "=== \"节点 1-3\""

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker node. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the "
"current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to `1`, `2`, or `3`."
msgstr ""
"在每个工作节点上运行此命令。将 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为当前节点的值，并将 `DP_START_RANK` 设置为 "
"`1`、`2` 或 `3`。"

msgid "The following values differ between the master and worker nodes:"
msgstr "以下值在主节点和工作节点之间有所不同："

msgid ""
"| Setting                       | Node 0         | Nodes 1-3         | "
"Description                                            |"
msgstr ""
"| 设置                          | 节点 0         | 节点 1-3          | 描述"
"                                                   |"

msgid ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                    | Node 0 IP      | Current worker IP | "
"Each node uses its own IP address.                     |"
msgstr ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                    | 节点 0 IP      | 当前工作节点 IP   | 每个节点使用自己的"
" IP 地址。                           |"

msgid ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                    | Not required   | Node 0 IP         | "
"Workers use this address to join the DP group.         |"
msgstr ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                    | 不需要         | 节点 0 IP         | "
"工作节点使用此地址加入 DP 组。                         |"

msgid ""
"    | `--headless`                  | Omitted        | Enabled           | "
"Workers do not expose the API endpoint.                |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--headless`                  | 省略           | 启用              | "
"工作节点不暴露 API 端点。                              |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address`     | `$LOCAL_IP`    | `$NODE0_IP`       | "
"Always resolves to Node 0.                             |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address`     | `$LOCAL_IP`    | `$NODE0_IP`       | "
"始终解析为节点 0。                                     |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`  | `0` by default | `1`, `2`, or `3`  | "
"Every node must own a unique DP rank.                  |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`  | 默认 `0`       | `1`、`2` 或 `3`   | "
"每个节点必须拥有唯一的 DP rank。                       |"

